## **Step 3: Install LLVM/Clang 3.8 (required for PROMPT)**

This is a bit involved since LLVM 3.8 is old and needs to be built from source:

```bash
mkdir -p /opt/llvm-3.8 && cd /opt/llvm-3.8

# Download LLVM 3.8
wget https://releases.llvm.org/3.8.0/llvm-3.8.0.src.tar.xz
tar xf llvm-3.8.0.src.tar.xz
mv llvm-3.8.0.src llvm-src

# Download Clang 3.8
cd llvm-src/tools
wget https://releases.llvm.org/3.8.0/cfe-3.8.0.src.tar.xz
tar xf cfe-3.8.0.src.tar.xz
mv cfe-3.8.0.src clang

# Build LLVM+Clang 3.8
cd /opt/llvm-3.8/llvm-src
mkdir build && cd build
cmake -G "Unix Makefiles" \
    -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release \
    -DLLVM_TARGETS_TO_BUILD="X86" \
    -DLLVM_ENABLE_ASSERTIONS=ON \
    -DLLVM_ENABLE_RTTI=ON \
    ..
```

After the cmake completes, run:

```bash
cd /opt/llvm-3.8/llvm-src/build
make -j$(nproc)
```

**Note:** The `make` step will take a while (20-60 minutes depending on CPU cores). Let me know once cmake finishes and the make starts (or if there are errors).

